OL,3,GNEWSA'Progress undermined' at prison as
OL,4,Aissues persist
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe running of an adult prison is still
OL,7,Fbeing affected by issues that it
OL,8,Fpreviously faced as a young offender
OL,9,Finstitution, an independent board says.
OL,11,FIn April 2023, while a young offender
OL,12,Finstitution, an urgent notification was
OL,13,Fissued to Cookham Wood in Rochester,
OL,14,FKent, about the poor physical condition
OL,15,Fof the estate and demoralised staff.
OL,17,FCookham Wood became an adult prison in
OL,18,FAugust 2024 and the prison's
OL,19,Findependent monitoring board (IMB) says
OL,20,Fin its 2024-2025 annual report,
OL,21,Fpublished on Friday, these issues
OL,22,Fcontinue to impact how it is run.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
